# Input

```svelte
{#each animals as { key, value = 1, arrayExpr = [{ a: true }], objectExpr = { a: true, b: [1] } }}
    <p>{key}: {value}</p>
{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@
-{#each animals as { key, value = 1, arrayExpr = [{ a: true }], objectExpr = { a: true, b: [1] } }}
+{#each animals as {
+    key,
+    value = 1,
+    arrayExpr = [{ a: true }],
+    objectExpr = { a: true, b: [1] },
+}}
     <p>{key}: {value}</p>
 {/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each animals as {
    key,
    value = 1,
    arrayExpr = [{ a: true }],
    objectExpr = { a: true, b: [1] },
}}
    <p>{key}: {value}</p>
{/each}
```
